      "id": "2067127394234704079",
      "text": "Yes, and let me tell you another thing\n\nI never subscribed to Max plan, be it from Anthropic or ClosedAI, buf Fable it's thr first one to make me do it\n\nNot only that, but also the first one to make me actually use my 5 hour limits, as I felt otherwise I'll waste time and usefulness\n\nWith other models i rarely filled it up as I was not constantly on, and also it's so much work with them when I think about it my head hurts so i just didnt\n\nBut man Fable was something else, it was like it actually understand you and one-shotted them! It was mesmerizing",
